{"id":49866,"date":"2026-03-10T12:45:17","date_gmt":"2026-03-10T11:45:17","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=49866"},"modified":"2026-08-28T15:36:58","modified_gmt":"2026-08-28T14:36:58","slug":"meia-maratona-do-concelho-de-castro-marim","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/meia-maratona-do-concelho-de-castro-marim\/","title":{"rendered":"17\u00aa Meia Maratona do Concelho de Castro Marim 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 1 - DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre A <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">17\u00aa Meia Maratona do Concelho de Castro Marim 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>17\u00aa Meia Maratona do Concelho de Castro Marim<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>12 de Setembro de 2026 (S\u00e1bado)<\/strong>, em <strong>Altura<\/strong> (concelho de Castro Marim, distrito de Faro). Organizada pelo Clube Recreativo Alturense em parceria com a Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo do Algarve, a prova celebra a sua 3\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o noturna, transformando as art\u00e9rias costeiras de Altura num ambiente festivo de corrida sob as estrelas do final do ver\u00e3o algarvio.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com tiro de partida agendado para as <strong>20:00<\/strong> junto \u00e0 Pista de Atletismo de Altura, o evento disponibiliza a <strong>Meia Maratona 21,097 km e a Minimaratona 10,5 km<\/strong>. O percurso noturno beneficia de temperaturas amenas e brisa mar\u00edtima, ideal para os atletas procurarem marcas pessoais. Se procura preparar o seu calend\u00e1rio de provas, pode consultar o nosso direct\u00f3rio de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-algarve\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;\">calend\u00e1rio de corridas no Algarve<\/a> ou o nosso guia de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/meia-maratona\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;\">guias de meia maratona<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O evento conta com arbitragem t\u00e9cnica da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo do Algarve, secretariado dedicado no pr\u00f3prio dia da prova e abastecimentos estrat\u00e9gicos ao longo do tra\u00e7ado, garantindo elevados padr\u00f5es de seguran\u00e7a e apoio a todos os corredores e acompanhantes.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 2 - FICHA T\u00c9CNICA --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">12 de Setembro de 2026 \u00e0s 20:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Altura, Castro Marim, Faro<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Meia Maratona 21,097 km e Minimaratona 10,5 km<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Clube Recreativo Alturense &#038; Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo do Algarve<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">2 horas e 30 minutos (Hora limite de chegada \u00e0s 22:30)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Abastecimentos<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Abastecimentos l\u00edquidos aos 6 km, 10 km, 16 km e 20 km<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 3 - GEOMETRIA & PERCURSO --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Geometria da Prova &#038; <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Percurso<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O percurso da <strong>17\u00aa Meia Maratona do Concelho de Castro Marim<\/strong> desenrola-se num circuito totalmente urbano de 4 voltas na Avenida 24 de Junho em Altura (2 voltas para a Minimaratona de 10,5 km). O piso \u00e9 100% asfalto pavimentado, permitindo um rolar fluido e constante sem tro\u00e7os irregulares.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O perfil altim\u00e9trico \u00e9 <em>perfil muito r\u00e1pido e predominantemente plano<\/em>, apresentando desn\u00edvel nulo e poucas curvas acentuadas, o que favorece uma cad\u00eancia uniforme e excelente gest\u00e3o de esfor\u00e7o. A corrida noturna afasta o calor abrasador do dia algarvio, oferecendo um clima balnear agrad\u00e1vel com vento brando vindo do Oceano Atl\u00e2ntico.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 4 - CALCULADORA DE PACE --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card pr-calc-event-banner\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15) 0%, rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.4) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 20px; padding: 24px 28px; margin-bottom: 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 260px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 6px;\">\u23f1\ufe0f Calcule o seu Tempo Alvo no 17\u00aa Meia Maratona do Concelho de Castro Marim 2026<\/h3>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; margin: 0;\">Utilize a nossa calculadora de pace para definir parciais ideais e gerir o seu ritmo de corrida com precis\u00e3o.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" class=\"pr-calc-event-btn\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 0%, #8B5CF6 100%); color: #0F172A; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 12px; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; white-space: nowrap;\">Calculadora de Pace \u2192<\/a><\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 5 - ONDE FICAR --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\ud83c\udfe8 Onde Ficar em <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Castro Marim<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Para atletas e fam\u00edlias que pretendem pernoitar na regi\u00e3o antes ou depois do <strong>17\u00aa Meia Maratona do Concelho de Castro Marim 2026<\/strong>, recomendamos reservas antecipadas em zonas estrat\u00e9gicas de Castro Marim:<\/p>\n<ul style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><strong>Praia de Altura (Zona da Partida &#038; Meta):<\/strong> Localiza\u00e7\u00e3o privilegiada na Avenida 24 de Junho, a poucos passos da Pista de Atletismo e da linha de partida.<\/li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><strong>Vila Hist\u00f3rica de Castro Marim:<\/strong> Excelente op\u00e7\u00e3o para quem deseja explorar o Castelo, a Reserva Natural do Sapal e a gastronomia local.<\/li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><strong>Monte Gordo &#038; Vila Real de Santo Ant\u00f3nio:<\/strong> Eixo hoteleiro vizinho com vasta oferta de alojamento e r\u00e1pido acesso rodovi\u00e1rio a Altura.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 6 - GASTRONOMIA & ACOMPANHANTES --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\ud83c\udf0d Sobre o Local &#038; <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Gastronomia Regional<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A regi\u00e3o de <strong>Castro Marim<\/strong> oferece um patrim\u00f3nio cultural e paisag\u00edstico rico. Ap\u00f3s o esfor\u00e7o da prova, os participantes podem desfrutar dos sabores locais da gastronomia regional, como <em>cataplana de conquilhas, estupeta de atum, flor de sal de Castro Marim e doce da casa algarvio<\/em> em restaurantes t\u00edpicos da localidade.<\/p>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 20px; margin-top: 20px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83d\udc65 Guia de Acompanhantes &#038; Espectadores<\/h3>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Os acompanhantes e fam\u00edlias podem assistir \u00e0 prova e apoiar os atletas em locais estrat\u00e9gicos como <strong>Avenida 24 de Junho em Altura e zona da Pista de Atletismo de Altura (partida e meta)<\/strong>, desfrutando da anima\u00e7\u00e3o e do acolhimento local.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO CROSS-LINKING --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Outras Provas Recomendadas na <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Mesma Regi\u00e3o<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Descubra tamb\u00e9m outros eventos desportivos de relevo agendados para a \u00e9poca: <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-10km\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;\">corridas de 10 km<\/a> e <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-algarve\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;\">corridas no Algarve<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 7 - FAQS ALINHADAS COM FICHA T\u00c9CNICA --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas Frequentes <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">(17\u00aa Meia Maratona do Concelho de Castro Marim 2026)<\/span><\/h2>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;\">\n<details style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio de partida do 17\u00aa Meia Maratona do Concelho de Castro Marim 2026?<\/summary>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 0;\">O evento realiza-se no dia <strong>12 de Setembro de 2026 (S\u00e1bado)<\/strong>. Os hor\u00e1rios das v\u00e1rias partidas por prova e escal\u00e3o s\u00e3o os seguintes:<br \/>\u2022 15:00 \u00e0s 19:00 &#8211; Abertura do secretariado e levantamento de dorsais (Pista de Atletismo de Altura)<br \/>\u2022 19:50 &#8211; Abertura da c\u00e2mara de chamada<br \/>\u2022 19:55 &#8211; Sinal sonoro dos 5 minutos antes da partida<br \/>\u2022 20:00 &#8211; Partida simult\u00e2nea da 17\u00aa Meia Maratona (21,097 km) e 3\u00aa Minimaratona Noturna (10,5 km)<br \/>\u2022 22:30 &#8211; Hora limite de chegada (Cut-off 2h30)<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<details style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde se realiza a prova e qual \u00e9 o concelho e distrito?<\/summary>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 0;\">A partida tem lugar em <strong>Altura, Castro Marim<\/strong>, no distrito de <strong>Faro<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<details style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias oficiais dispon\u00edveis no 17\u00aa Meia Maratona do Concelho de Castro Marim 2026?<\/summary>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 0;\">O programa oficial disponibiliza as dist\u00e2ncias de <strong>Meia Maratona 21,097 km e Minimaratona 10,5 km<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<details style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem \u00e9 a entidade organizadora do 17\u00aa Meia Maratona do Concelho de Castro Marim 2026?<\/summary>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o do evento \u00e9 assegurada por <strong>Clube Recreativo Alturense &#038; Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo do Algarve<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<details style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar os resultados e as fotografias da prova?<\/summary>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 0;\">As classifica\u00e7\u00f5es finais e os tempos oficiais poder\u00e3o ser acedidos na p\u00e1gina da prova no portal <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;\">Portugal Running<\/a> ap\u00f3s o encerramento do evento. A fotorreportagem e as galerias de imagens poder\u00e3o ser pesquisadas atrav\u00e9s dos canais oficiais da organiza\u00e7\u00e3o e nas plataformas parceiras de cobertura fotogr\u00e1fica desportiva.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":49867,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,28,41],"event_type_2":[728,149,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-49866","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-castro-marim-faro","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-meiamaratona","event_type_2-algarve-e-sul","event_type_2-faro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/Popk44b83v346-2.jpg","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/49866","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=49866"}],"version-history":[{"count":4,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/49866\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":64957,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/49866\/revisions\/64957"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/49867"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=49866"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=49866"},{"taxonomy":"event_type","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type?post=49866"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_2",